    kim "I'm a coward, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1316
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_6be98b58:

    # mc "No lo eres, [kim]. Creo que nadie habría sabido reaccionar en tu situación."
    mc "You're not, [kim]. I don't think anyone would have known how to react in your situation."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1317
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_674422e7:

    # mc "Estoy seguro de que, si hubiera tardado un par de segundos en decirle a Ichigo que te traía al camarote, lo hubiera hecho [ama]."
    mc "I'm sure that, if I had taken a couple of seconds longer to tell Ichigo that I was bringing you to the cabin, [ama] would have done it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1318
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_09255eb3:

    # mc "Es la única que está entrenada para reaccionar rápido bajo presión."
    mc "She's the only one who's trained to react quickly under pressure."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1320
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_ca03c492:

    # kim "Pero tú lo has hecho y no estás entrenado. Yo me he quedado ahí, sin saber que hacer, como un conejo deslumbrado por los faros de un coche."
    kim "But you did it, and you're not trained. I just stood there, not knowing what to do, like a rabbit caught in the headlights."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1321
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_302fb5f9:

    # mc "No le des más vueltas. Lo importante es que estás a salvo."
    mc "Don't dwell on it. The important thing is that you're safe."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1322
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_ef0f3a70:

