    kim "If I weren't a coward, I'd be kissing you right now."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1325
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_f0ff79a3:

    # mc "No tienes por qué hacerlo por agradecimiento. [ama] hubiera hecho lo mismo si le hubiera dado tiempo."
    mc "You don't have to do that to thank me. [ama] would have done the same if she'd had time."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1327
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_c753e785:

