    kim "Yes, and I did it while you were in Monterey."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1334
translate english c25s002_KimSaved_a8eeec1e:

    # kim "Otra muestra de cobardía. Me tuvo que obligar [kat]. Me hizo lo que [deb.nick] te hizo a ti con [lis]."
    kim "Another show of cowardice. [kat] had to force me. She did to me what [deb.nick] did to you with [lis]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1353
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_de7b367e:

