    kim "She told me that she didn't mind that..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1355
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_3ad23dec:

    # kim "¿QUÉ? ¿Has dicho que vas a besarme?"
    kim "WHAT? Did you say you were going to kiss me?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1357
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_5e958d49:

    # "Vale más una imagen, o en este caso un beso, que mil palabras. Acallas sus preguntas poniendo tus labios sobre los suyos."
    "A picture, or in this case a kiss, is worth a thousand words. You silence her questions as you press your lips lightly against hers."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1358
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_17df26f5:

    # "Se queda paralizada como un conejo deslumbrado por los faros de un coche."
    "She stands frozen like a rabbit caught in the headlights."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1359
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_70763c3a:

    # "Es como besar una estatua. Una estatua que respira en tu boca, y cuyos labios son deliciosamente suaves."
    "It's like kissing a statue. A statue that breathes on your mouth, and whose lips are deliciously soft."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1361
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_4dfbacf4:

    # "La parálisis tan solo dura unos segundos, hasta que su cerebro procesa lo que está pasando."
