    kim "No... Saying it out loud... It looks like you're right. I'm stupid."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1374
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_98cffde8:

    # mc "No lo eres. Hoy te han pasado cosas raras y tu mente aún las está procesando."
    mc "You're not. You've had some strange things happen to you today, and your mind is still processing them."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1376
translate english c25s002_KimRoute_a7dd6f21:

