    mc "What I like is that neither of them seems happy. It's as if they're saying, 'It had to be done, but that doesn't mean we like it.'"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1756
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_bc8c2e8a:

    # deb "Exactamente eso. Te va a parecer gracioso, pero Vee y Mandy me recuerdan en cierta forma a [eva] y [ama]."
    deb "Exactly. You're going to think this is funny, but Vee and Mandy remind me of [eva] and [ama] in a way."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1757
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_be2df33f:

    # mc "¡Qué va! [ama] y [eva] son mucho más tiernas. Vee y Mandy son mucho más despiadadas."
    mc "No way! [ama] and [eva] are much sweeter. Vee and Mandy are much more ruthless."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1758
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_d9a3b146:

    # mc "¿Has desayunado ya?"
    mc "Have you had breakfast yet?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1760
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_461b7954:

    # deb "Sí, hace un rato. No quería hacer yoga con el estómago vacío, y al final me he quedado jugando."
    deb "Yes, a little while ago. I didn't want to do yoga on an empty stomach, and I ended up playing games instead."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1761
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_acd05f45:

    # mc "Pues te dejo jugando y voy a desayunar."
    mc "Then I'll leave you to play and I'll go have breakfast."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1764
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_77e0e675:

    # "Das un beso a la hermosa sirena, intentando no tirar el portátil."
    "You kiss the beautiful mermaid, trying not to drop her laptop."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1766
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_bc8b5b8c:

    # mc "Te veo luego. Me muero de hambre."
    mc "See you later. I'm starving."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1767
translate english c25s003_MyResidence_1f1f5279:

    # deb "Hasta luego, [mc]."
    deb "See you later, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1787
translate english c25s003_Yoga_482a03e9:

    # "Al entrar en la cocina te invade el olor de croissants recién hechos."
    "When you walk into the kitchen, you are enveloped by the smell of freshly baked croissants."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1788
translate english c25s003_Yoga_f080aca5:

    # "No puedes resistirte y, después de preparar un café, comes un par."
    "You can't resist, and after brewing a cup of coffee, you eat a couple."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1790
translate english c25s003_Yoga_6a39a92d:

    # "Mientras te tomas el café, te asomas a la ventana."
    "While you drink your coffee, you look out the window."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1791
translate english c25s003_Yoga_aca5b583:

    # "Recuerdas que [kia] dijo que un montón de chicas se apuntarían a la sesión de yoga de hoy."
    "You remember [kia] saying a bunch of girls were going to join the yoga session today."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1792
translate english c25s003_Yoga_92d27e8d:

    # "A este paso vais a tener que ampliar la piscina."
    "At this rate, you're going to have to enlarge the pool."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1793
translate english c25s003_Yoga_795f6dcc:

    # "Decides bajar a saludar y acabarte el café en la piscina. Estando todas juntas, va a ser más eficiente."
    "You decide to go downstairs to say hello and finish your coffee by the pool. With all those girls together, it will be more efficient."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1795
translate english c25s003_Yoga_0f266157:

    # mc "Buenos días, chicas. Hace un día genial para veros hacer yoga sin unirme. *Risa*"
    mc "Good morning, girls. It's a great day to watch you do yoga without joining in. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1796
translate english c25s003_Yoga_08dc160d:

    # mcp "(No tengo intención de volver a ponerme las mallas de Tío Mike en mi vida.)"
    mcp "(I have no intention of ever putting on Uncle Mike's tights again in my life.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1798
translate english c25s003_Yoga_0b288a70:

    # "Sin interrumpir sus ejercicios ni decir nada, todas te dedican una sonrisa."
    "Without interrupting their exercises or saying anything, they all smile at you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1799
translate english c25s003_Yoga_6cb7a019:

    # "Una preciosa imagen para empezar el día. Como has pensado, mucho más eficiente."
    "A beautiful image to start the day. As you thought, much more efficient."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1800
translate english c25s003_Yoga_5d07fb2b:

    # kat "Me estás tapando las vistas, [mc]."
    kat "You're blocking my view, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1802
translate english c25s003_Yoga_84a3d87d:

    # mc "¡Oh, [kat]! Perdona, no te había visto."
    mc "Oh, [kat]! Sorry, I didn't see you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1803
translate english c25s003_Yoga_019b7d21:

    # kat "*Risa* Lo difícil es no verme con lo que abulto, pero te entiendo. Es difícil apartar los ojos de esas trece mujeres."
    kat "*Laugh* It's hard not to see me with my size, but I understand. It's harder to take your eyes off those thirteen women."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1804
translate english c25s003_Yoga_ce27227c:

    # mc "*Risa* No las había contado."
    mc "*Laugh* I didn't count them."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1806
translate english c25s003_Yoga_c7194c7b:

    # kat "*Risa* Bueno, aparte de mirar, no he tenido mucho que hacer en los últimos 10 minutos."
    kat "*Laugh* Well, apart from watching, I haven't had much to do in the last 10 minutes."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1807
translate english c25s003_Yoga_6d4db9af:

    # kat "Y si no sales de en medio, no voy a poder seguir mirando."
    kat "And if you don't get out of the way, I won't be able to keep watching."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1809
translate english c25s003_Yoga_70d56761:

    # kat "{i}(¡Deja de mirar, [kat]! ¡Céntrate! Ni te va a mirar con el espectáculo que hay detrás suyo.){/i}"
    kat "{i}(Stop staring, [kat]! Focus! He's not even going to look at you with the show going on behind him.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1811
translate english c25s003_Yoga_e8b4c525:

    # mc "¿Estoy bien aquí? ¿No te tapo las vistas ahora?"
    mc "Am I okay here? Am I blocking your view now?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1812
translate english c25s003_Yoga_538eee44:

    # kat "Sí, ahí estás bien."
    kat "Yes, you're fine there."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1813
translate english c25s003_Yoga_7c72c85d:

    # kat "Además, justo a tiempo para el cambio de postura."
    kat "What's more, just in time for the next posture."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1815
translate english c25s003_Yoga_416ed5b5:

    # mc "Casi parece que estén haciendo una coreografía, ¿no?"
    mc "It almost looks like they're doing a choreographed routine, doesn't it?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1816
translate english c25s003_Yoga_0de4beb4:

    # kat "Todas siguen lo que hace [nor]. Y quien no puede, sigue a [sai], que también conoce todos los movimientos."
    kat "They all follow [nor]. And those who can't, follow [sai]. She also knows all the movements, but does an easier version in the hardest positions."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1817
translate english c25s003_Yoga_36157d72:

    # mc "*Risa* Veo que lo tienes todo estudiado."
    mc "*Laugh* I see you've got it all figured out."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1819
translate english c25s003_Yoga_1a6e8f52:

    # kat "*Risa* Bajar a desayunar aquí es una de las mejores vistas de la casa."
    kat "*Laugh* Coming down here for breakfast is one of the best views in the house."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1820
translate english c25s003_Yoga_29ca9c16:

    # mc "*Risa* No voy a decir lo contrario. ¿Bajas muy a menudo?"
    mc "*Laugh* I'm not going to disagree. Do you come here often?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1821
translate english c25s003_Yoga_24988b39:

    # kat "No bajo todos los días. Cuando tengo clase a primera hora es complicado."
    kat "I don't come every day. It's hard when I have early classes."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1822
translate english c25s003_Yoga_29c85ce7:

    # mc "Entiendo. ¿Tienes algún plan para hoy?"
    mc "I understand. Do you have any plans for today?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1824
translate english c25s003_Yoga_f122de9b:

    # kat "*Risa* NO ir a correr al lago es el primer plan. Hoy es mi día de descanso sin ejercicio."
    kat "*Laugh* NOT going running at the lake is the first plan. Today is my day off from exercise."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1825
translate english c25s003_Yoga_fe06ee76:

    # kat "El segundo era bajar aquí a ver a las chicas haciendo yoga. [eil], [oma], y [kia] no se apuntan nunca, y [sam] solo es la segunda vez que viene."
    kat "The second was to come down here to see the girls doing yoga. [eil], [oma], and [kia] never sign up, and [sam] is only here for the second time."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1826
translate english c25s003_Yoga_58f7fbd7:

    # kat "No podía perdérmelo."
    kat "I couldn't miss it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1827
translate english c25s003_Yoga_87bf4a62:

    # mc "¿Y más allá de ver chicas en leggins?"
    mc "And beyond seeing girls in leggings?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1829
translate english c25s003_Yoga_0652bea0:

    # kat "*Risa* Más allá no he pensado nada."
    kat "*Laugh* I haven't thought beyond that."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1830
translate english c25s003_Yoga_38dfc874:

    # kat "Supongo que estudiar un rato, leer, y hacer el vago hasta la hora de comer."
    kat "I guess I'll study for a while, read, and then laze around until lunchtime."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1831
translate english c25s003_Yoga_ca3709f4:

    # mc "*Risa* Es un plan perfecto para un domingo."
    mc "*Laugh* That's a perfect plan for a Sunday."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1833
translate english c25s003_Yoga_cbcfa4c4:

    # kat "¡Oh, por el amor de Dios! Adoro esa postura. No sería capaz de hacerla aunque me pagaran por ello."
    kat "Oh, for goodness' sake! I love that position. I couldn't do it even if you paid me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1834
translate english c25s003_Yoga_89a73eb7:

    # mc "*Risa* Yo tampoco. ¿Entiendes ahora por qué no me apunto a las sesiones de yoga?"
    mc "*Laugh* Me neither. Now do you understand why I don't sign up for yoga sessions?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1836
translate english c25s003_Yoga_a49cb0dd:

    # kat "Visto que compartimos gustos por las vistas... ¿por qué no quedamos para desayunar juntos alguna mañana?"
    kat "Since we share the same taste in views... why don't we meet up for breakfast sometime?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1838
translate english c25s003_Yoga_8cfc6c8d:

    # kat "{i}(¡Mierda, [kat]! ¡Eso ha sonado como si le pidieras una cita! ¿Dónde has dejado tu cerebro hoy?){/i}"
    kat "{i}(Shit, [kat]! That sounded like you were asking him out on a date! Where's your brain today?){/i}"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1839
translate english c25s003_Yoga_dd0bb5a2:

    # mc "No te puedo asegurar nada, pero me parece una idea genial."
    mc "I can't promise anything, but I think it's a great idea."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1841
translate english c25s003_Yoga_ce86d6b6:

    # kat "{i}(¿Ha dicho que sí? ¿No podría haberse negado y así dejarme las cosas claras?){/i}"
    kat "{i}(Did he say yes? Couldn't he have said no and left things clear?){/i}"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1842
translate english c25s003_Yoga_6901a23b:

    # mcp "(¿De qué se sorprende? ¿No quiere que desayunemos juntos? ¿Por qué lo ha propuesto?)"
    mcp "(What's so surprising? Doesn't she want to have breakfast together? Why did she suggest it, then?)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1843
translate english c25s003_Yoga_5ca9b544:

    # "Suena tu móvil. Es el correo de [ama] con la información que le pediste anoche."
    "Your phone rings. It's an email from [ama] with the information you asked for last night."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1844
translate english c25s003_Yoga_1b980033:

    # mc "Dame un momento, tengo que leer un correo."
    mc "Give me a moment, I have to read an email."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1846
translate english c25s003_Yoga_336253eb:

    # kat "{i}(¡Joder, [mc]! ¿Lo puedes poner más difícil?){/i}"
    kat "{i}(Damn it, [mc]! Can you make it any harder?){/i}"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1848
translate english c25s003_Yoga_81b1d609:

    # mc "[kat], te tengo que dejar. Tengo que hacer una llamada."
    mc "[kat], I have to go. I have to make a call."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1849
translate english c25s003_Yoga_b00c8c74:

    # kat "No te preocupes, aunque te vas a perder las últimas posturas."
    kat "Don't worry, you'll just miss the last few postures."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1850
translate english c25s003_Yoga_1eb34e55:

    # mc "*Risa* Las veré el día que desayunemos juntos. Cuento contigo como comentarista."
    mc "*Laugh* I'll see them the day we have breakfast together. I'm counting on you as a commentator."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1851
translate english c25s003_Yoga_8443039f:

    # mc "¿Puedes dejar mi taza en tu bandeja, por favor?"
    mc "Can you put my cup on your tray, please?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1853
translate english c25s003_Yoga_53041b4b:

    # "Te mueves a la puerta del garaje para llamar a Sound. Intentas mantener un tono amigable."
    "You walk to the garage door to call Sound. You try to keep your tone friendly."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1854
translate english c25s003_Yoga_28e9ff02:

    # mc "Buenos días, Jeff. Soy [mc] Marks. Espero no molestarte tan temprano."
    mc "Good morning, Jeff. This is [mc] Marks. I hope I'm not disturbing you too early."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1855
translate english c25s003_Yoga_d7153acc:

    # jef "Buenos días, Sr. Marks. No se preocupe. ¿En qué puedo ayudarle?"
    jef "Good morning, Mr. Marks. Don't worry. How can I help you?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1857
translate english c25s003_Yoga_3a6c962e:

    # mc "Te llamaba por lo que pasó ayer en el barco. Con la chica..."
    mc "I was calling you about what happened yesterday on the yacht. With the girl..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1858
translate english c25s003_Yoga_13de4800:

    # jef "¿De qué quería hablar sobre ese tema?"
    jef "What did you want to talk about?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1859
translate english c25s003_Yoga_a7fb9abd:

    # mc "No sé lo que Ichigo tiene planeado con ella, pero no la vais a volver a contratar."
    mc "I don't know what Ichigo plans to do with her, but you're not going to hire her again."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1860
translate english c25s003_Yoga_ab9b3eec:

    # jef "Perdone, Sr. Marks, pero no está en posición de decir quién puede o no puede contratar Iron Fist."
    jef "Excuse me, Mr. Marks, but you're not in a position to say who can or cannot be hired by Iron Fist."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1862
translate english c25s003_Yoga_4603a574:

    # "El tono amigable desaparece de tu voz."
    "The friendly tone disappears from your voice."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1863
translate english c25s003_Yoga_52a371b3:

    # mc "Tiene razón. No puedo decirles a quién tienen que contratar."
    mc "You're right. I can't tell you who you can hire."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1864
translate english c25s003_Yoga_ec357799:

    # mc "Pero puedo revisar todos los contratos que nuestra división de Apoyo tiene con Iron Fist. Mis antecesores pusieron una cláusula que nos eximía en caso de fuerza mayor."
    mc "But I can review all the contracts our Support division has with Iron Fist. My predecessors included a clause that exempts us in cases of unforeseen circumstances."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1865
translate english c25s003_Yoga_a79b60c2:

    # jef "No puede hacer eso. La reputación de NTR..."
    jef "You can't do that. NTR's reputation..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1867
translate english c25s003_Yoga_912af936:

    # mc "La reputación de NTR quedará intacta. Estaremos cumpliendo el contrato. Los contratos."
    mc "NTR's reputation will remain intact. We will be fulfilling the contract. The contracts."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1868
translate english c25s003_Yoga_808169d6:

    # mc "El martes hay un despliegue de operativos de Iron Fist en Venezuela usando un avión de NTR como transporte. Es posible que ese avión tenga algún problema con los motores."
    mc "On Tuesday, there will be a deployment of Iron Fist operatives in Venezuela using an NTR plane for transport. It is possible that the plane will have engine trouble."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1869
translate english c25s003_Yoga_d02ea4ac:

    # mc "Tres días después, extracción de esos operativos en la costa. Mmmm... creo que el barco que íbamos a enviar tiene un problema y hace aguas."
    mc "Three days later, extraction of those operatives on the coast. Hmm... I think the ship we were going to send has a problem and is taking on water."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1870
translate english c25s003_Yoga_b2b81e8c:

    # mc "¿Sigo? Hay once contratos para los próximos tres meses."
    mc "Shall I continue? There are eleven contracts for the next three months."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1871
translate english c25s003_Yoga_94fbceff:

    # jef "No, Sr. Marks. No hace falta que continúe."
    jef "No, Mr. Marks. There's no need to continue."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1873
translate english c25s003_Yoga_02f8e7ca:

    # mc "Ustedes nos necesitan a nosotros. Nosotros no les necesitamos a ustedes."
    mc "You need us. We don't need you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1874
translate english c25s003_Yoga_b8546b5b:

    # mc "Ya sabe. No volverán a contratar a la Srta. Brown, ni harán ningún informe negativo sobre ninguno de sus dos contratos con ustedes."
    mc "You know. You won't hire Ms. Brown again, and you won't write any negative reports about either of her two gigs with you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1875
translate english c25s003_Yoga_e7cb3e0f:

    # jef "Lo entiendo. Se lo comunicaré al Sr. Ichigo. Se pondrá en contacto con usted."
    jef "I understand. I will let Mr. Ichigo know. He will contact you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1877
translate english c25s003_Yoga_05d8d838:

    # mc "No hace falta que Ichigo pierda su tiempo llamándome. Que envíe un 'OK' junto a la oferta que me tiene que enviar para la absorción o fusión."
    mc "Ichigo doesn't need to waste his time calling me. Just send an 'OK' along with the offer he has to send me for the takeover or merger."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1878
translate english c25s003_Yoga_fe35dedf:

    # mc "El mismo tipo de suspensión de contratos se aplicará si alguien de Iron Fist se acerca a alguien de mi familia, o si ponen alguna queja ante la agencia de la Srta. Brown."
    mc "The same type of contract suspension will apply if anyone from Iron Fist approaches anyone in my family, or if you file a complaint with Ms. Brown's agency."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1879
translate english c25s003_Yoga_d3fe41ce:

    # mc "¿Entendido?"
    mc "Understood?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1880
translate english c25s003_Yoga_cb47e656:

    # jef "Entendido, Sr. Marks."
    jef "Understood, Mr. Marks."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1881
translate english c25s003_Yoga_f7467f31:

    # mc "Que tenga un buen día, Sr. Sound."
    mc "Have a nice day, Mr. Sound."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1883
translate english c25s003_Yoga_798928a5:

    # mcp "(Sound parece un buen tipo, pero tiene que defender su empresa. Supongo que es difícil trabajar para alguien como Ichigo.)"
    mcp "(Sound seems like a nice guy, but he has to defend his company. I guess it's hard to work for someone like Ichigo.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1884
translate english c25s003_Yoga_d45b95c1:

    # "Cuando estás a punto de girarte volver con [kat]..."
    "When you're about to return with [kat]..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1885
translate english c25s003_Yoga_4ccac790:

    # kim "*Jadeo de sorpresa*"
    kim "*Surprised gasp*"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1887
translate english c25s003_Yoga_3af9bd6a:

    # kim "¿Qué has hecho, [mc]?"
    kim "What have you done, [mc]?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1888
translate english c25s003_Yoga_f06892bd:

    # mc "¿Cuánto llevas ahí, [kim]?"
    mc "How long have you been there, [kim]?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1889
translate english c25s003_Yoga_d638db65:

    # kim "Desde que has dicho algo de Venezuela..."
    kim "Since you mentioned Venezuela..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1891
translate english c25s003_Yoga_3394374b:

    # kim "Y después has dicho lo de mi contrato y los informes a la agencia..."
    kim "And then you brought up my contract and the reports to the agency..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1892
translate english c25s003_Yoga_ee048b03:

    # mc "No puedo dejar que seas una víctima en una guerra que no va contigo, [kim]. No sería justo."
    mc "I can't let you be a victim in a war that has nothing to do with you, [kim]. It wouldn't be fair."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1899
translate english c25s003_Yoga_f703d36b:

    # "Miss Mapache California 2023 se lanza a darte un beso en el que hay tanto agradecimiento como pasión."
    "Miss Raccoon California 2023 throws herself at you to kiss you with as much gratitude as passion."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1902
translate english c25s003_Yoga_c6d4cb33:

    # "[kim] se lanza a darte un abrazo en el que hay tanto agradecimiento como alivio."
    "[kim] throws her arms around you in a hug that conveys both gratitude and relief."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1904
translate english c25s003_Yoga_f97594fc:

    # kim "Gracias, [mc]. No sé cómo darte las gracias por algo así..."
    kim "Thank you, [mc]. I don't know how to thank you for something like this..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:1905
translate english c25s003_Yoga_c39f7a0e:

    # mc "No hace falta darlas pero, de todas formas, lo acabas de hacer."
