    # zeu "¡Miau! (¡Otra vez tú! Pero esta vez hueles a lata de atún... lata de atún cerrada...)"
    zeu "*Meow!* *Meow...* (You again! But this time you smell like a can of tuna... a closed can of tuna...)"

