    mad "Give me a moment to grab my bag and we can go. I also need to grab something else..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3189
translate english c25s004_GetMad_326d9f1b:

    # mc "*Risa* Te espero acariciando a Zeus."
    mc "*Laugh* I'll wait for you there, petting Zeus."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3191
translate english c25s004_GetMad_b9015529:

    # zeu "¡Miau! (¡Sí, caricias para Lord Simba!)"
    zeu "*Meow!* (Yes, petting for Lord Simba!)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3193
translate english c25s004_GetMad_df76e855:

    # "Os ponéis en camino unos minutos después. Zeus se pasa todo el viaje con la cabeza dentro de la bolsa donde está la lata de atún."
    "You set off a few minutes later. Zeus spends the entire journey with his head inside the bag containing the can of tuna."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3194
translate english c25s004_GetMad_8c466a7c:

    # "Por suerte, no sabe abrirla... O es demasiado vago para hacerlo y está esperando que sus sirvientes humanos lo hagan por él."
    "Luckily, he doesn't know how to open it... Or he's too lazy to do it and is waiting for his human servants to do it for him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3251
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_c1e656bf:

    # "Al llegar a casa, vais directos a la cocina de [nor]."
    "When you get home, you go straight to [nor]'s kitchen."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3252
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ef64a4e3:

    # mc "Te dejo los pepinillos que me has pedido en la nevera."
    mc "I'll leave the pickles you asked for in the fridge."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3253
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b1c907a2:

    # nor "Gracias, [mc]."
    nor "Thanks, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3254
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7549b2ae:

    # nor "Hola, [mad.nick]."
    nor "Hi, [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3257
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_9c50a15a:

    # "Al llegar a casa, dejas el pollo que te ha pedido [mar] en la nevera y vais a la cocina de [nor]."
    "When you get home, you put the chicken that [mar] asked for in the fridge and go to [nor]'s kitchen."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3259
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d6cfd815:

    # "Al llegar a casa, dejas los pepinillos en la nevera, le mandas un mensaje a [whoPickles], y vais a la cocina de [nor]."
    "When you get home, you put the pickles in the fridge, send a message to [whoPickles], and go to [nor]'s kitchen."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3260
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7c234c8f:

    # nor "Hola, [mad.nick]. Hola de nuevo, [mc]."
    nor "Hello, [mad.nick]. Hello again, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3261
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_71b1c336:

    # nor "¿Llevas un gato en la bolsa, [mad.nick]?"
    nor "Are you carrying a cat in that bag, [mad.nick]?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3263
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_57a99d67:

    # mad "Hola, [nor]. *Risa* Sí, es Zeus. Creo que está intentando abrir la lata de atún que [mc] le ha comprado."
    mad "Hi, [nor]. *Laugh* Yes, it's Zeus. I think he's trying to open the can of tuna [mc] brought him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3264
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_0ca02bc7:

    # mc "Es un pequeño glotón. Te lo ganarás si le das comida."
    mc "He's a little glutton. You'll win him over if you give him food."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3266
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_41f59f42:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿He oído que esta señora reparte comida?)"
    zeu "*Meow?* (Did I hear that lady is handing out food?)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3267
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_3b938227:

    # mc "*Risa* A veces creo que nos entiende. Oye la palabra 'comida' y se olvida de lo que estaba haciendo."
    mc "*Laugh* Sometimes I think he understands us. He hears the word 'food' and forgets what he's doing."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3269
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_07ff799a:

    # mad "¿Quieres que lo deje en algún sitio donde no moleste? Está bien educado, y no va a hacer sus cosas en el suelo ni a arañar los muebles."
    mad "Would you like me to leave him somewhere where he won't be in the way? He's well-behaved, and he won't do his things on the floor or scratch the furniture."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3271
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_6a2f5e12:

    # nor "Si está bien educado lo puedes dejar suelto. ¿Le puedo dar un trozo de salchicha?"
    nor "If he's well-behaved, you can let him loose. Can I give him a piece of sausage?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3273
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_99acdd36:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Si dices que no, sé dónde duermes. Mi cola puede meterse en tu boca sin que yo pueda, o quiera, hacer nada por evitarlo.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (If you say no, I know where you sleep. My tail can get into your mouth without me being able to, or wanting to, do anything to stop it.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3275
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_fbb3b9ff:

    # mad "Creo que no habrá ningún problema. Come de todo."
    mad "I don't think there will be any problem. He eats just about anything."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3276
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7f2d48c2:

    # mc "*Risa* Además, Zeus tendrá una nueva mejor amiga."
    mc "*Laugh* Plus, Zeus will have a new best friend."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3277
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_8df3ef23:

    # mc "Dame la bolsa, [mad.nick], voy a guardar las cosas en la nevera."
    mc "Give me the bag, [mad.nick], I'm going to put the things in the fridge."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3279
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_308493de:

    # "El gato, como siempre, parece entender lo que estáis diciendo y salta ágilmente de la bolsa a la isla de la cocina."
    "The cat, as always, seems to understand what you are saying and jumps nimbly from the bag onto the kitchen island."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3280
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d7055b23:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Tienes mi autorización para alimentarme, humana.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (You have my permission to feed me, human.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3282
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_8a4f2de9:

    # mad "¡Zeus! ¡Baja de ahí ahora mismo! Acabo de decirles que estás bien educado."
    mad "Zeus! Get down from there right now! I just told them you're well-mannered."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3284
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f49740ea:

    # zeu "*Miau lastimero* (Pero el tipo feo le ha dicho a la Alimentadora Suprema que si hay comida por en medio me olvido de todo...)"
    zeu "*Pitiful meow* (But the ugly guy told the Supreme Feeder that if there's food involved, I forget everything...)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3286
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_e98194c3:

    # mad "Zeeeeus..."
    mad "Zeeeeus..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3288
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_0690a050:

    # zeu "*Miaaaau* (Vaaaaale.)"
    zeu "*Meooow* (Okaaay.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3290
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ebb7109f:

    # "Baja del mostrador tan ágilmente como ha subido, aunque por alguna razón te parece que lo hace con cara de pena."
    "He climbs down from the counter as nimbly as he climbed up, although for some reason it seems to you that he does so with a sad expression on his face."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3291
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_94415e2c:

    # "Rodea la isla de la cocina para ir a los pies de [nor]."
    "He goes around the kitchen island to get to [nor]'s feet."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3293
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_4fb1d052:

    # nor "Realmente lo has educado muy bien. Felicidades, [mad.nick]. Siempre he oído que los gatos son más difíciles de educar que los perros."
    nor "You've really trained him well. Congratulations, [mad.nick]. I've always heard that cats are harder to train than dogs."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3294
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_800adf8b:

    # mc "*Risa* A mí siempre me han parecido más listos que los perros."
    mc "*Laugh* I've always thought they were smarter than dogs."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3295
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_eece51dd:

    # mc "Un perro es como un niño pequeño, siempre haciendo ruido, necesitando atención, y emocionándose por todo."
    mc "A dog is like a small child, always making noise, needing attention, and getting excited about everything."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3296
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f710df82:

    # mc "Un gato es como un jubilado. *Risa* Se deja alimentar y sólo te presta atención cuando a él le da la gana."
    mc "A cat is like a grumpy retiree. *Laugh* It lets you feed it and only pays attention to you when it feels like it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3298
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_6a8e89aa:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Escuchad a este tío. Sabe de lo que habla.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Listen to this guy. He knows what he's talking about.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3299
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_c30791f8:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿Dónde está mi salchicha?)"
    zeu "*Meow?* (Where's my sausage?)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3301
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_5247916e:

    # nor "¿Quieres un trozo de salchicha, chiquitín?"
    nor "Would you like a piece of sausage, Little one?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3302
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_4917eeff:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¡Sí! ¡Alimenta a tu Señor!)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Yes! Feed your Lord!)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3304
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_903b361d:

    # "La salchicha desaparece en un momento en la boca del felino."
    "The sausage disappears in an instant in the feline's mouth."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3305
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_bf052574:

    # zeu "*Miau* (He puesto mi sagrada zarpa sobre ti. Ahora eres mía.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (I placed my Sacred Paw on you. Now you are mine.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3307
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_023ef6eb:

    # nor "*Risa* Es super bonito. Y muy simpático."
    nor "*Laugh* He's really cute. And very friendly."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3308
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d1866030:

    # mc "*Risa* Mientras le des comida seguirá siendo simpático, no lo dudes."
    mc "*Laugh* As long as you feed him, he'll stay friendly, don't worry."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3310
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_766bb000:

    # mad "[mc], ¿podrías enseñarle la casa a Zeus mientras yo ayudo a [nor] con la comida? Sobre todo, enséñale dónde están los lavabos."
    mad "[mc], could you show Zeus around the house while I help [nor] with lunch? Above all, show him where the restrooms are."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3311
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_948d1c75:

    # mc "Estás de broma, ¿no?"
    mc "Are you kidding me?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3312
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_5f5eb2ec:

    # mad "No, le he enseñado a hacer sus cosas en el retrete. Hay que dejar la puerta abierta y la tapa levantada."
    mad "No, I taught him to use the toilet. You have to leave the door open and the lid up."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3314
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f4b4206c:

    # nor "Eso lo he visto en varias películas y en videos de internet. Parece que es algo común. Cada vez más gente vive en apartamentos."
    nor "I saw that in several movies and internet videos. It seems to be common. More and more people live in apartments."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3315
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7b8b0137:

    # mc "Vamos, Zeus. Voy a enseñarte la casa y a presentarte al resto de la familia."
    mc "Come on, Zeus. I'll show you around the house and introduce you to the rest of the family."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3317
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_e240b5d7:

    # "Antes de que te dé tiempo de irte con el gato aparecen las dos primeras chicas nuevas. Al menos nuevas para Zeus."
    "Before you have time to leave with the cat, the first two new girls show up. At least new to Zeus."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3318
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b7c47a1e:

    # dap "¿Has traído a Zeus, [mad.nick]?"
    dap "Did you bring Zeus, [mad.nick]?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3319
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_660e4f31:

    # mad "Sí, [mc] me ha dicho que os gustaría conocerlo."
    mad "Yes, [mc] told me you would like to meet him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3320
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_9d2f8ab2:

    # eri "No se ha equivocado. Tanto oír hablar de él, ya tenía ganas de verlo."
    eri "He's right. I've heard so much about him that I was eager to meet him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3322
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_e3998c0a:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Vuestro color de pelo me confunde. Pero ahora sois mías.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Your hair color confuses me. But now you're mine.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3323
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_8c047715:

    # mad "Creo que le habéis caído bien."
    mad "I think he likes you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3325
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f80ebe80:

    # eri "¡Es precioso!"
    eri "He's adorable!"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3326
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_c51120b9:

    # dap "¡Y se deja tocar por desconocidos! Me encanta."
    dap "And he lets strangers touch him! I love it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3327
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_84ce6875:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Rascad, esclavas, rascad.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Scratch, servants, scratch.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3330
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_6c0166bf:

    # dap "Hola, [mc]. Nos tienes que explicar lo que pasó en el barco. [kim] nos ha explicado algo, pero hay partes que no sabe."
    dap "Hello, [mc]. You must explain to us what happened on the ship. [kim] explained some things to us, but there are parts she doesn't know."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3331
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_2f307c20:

    # mc "Luego os lo explico."
    mc "I'll explain it to you later."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3334
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_3a916b49:

    # eri "Hola, cielo. Antes, durante el yoga, has desaparecido antes de que te saludara."
    eri "Hello, honey. Earlier, during yoga, you disappeared before I could say hello."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3335
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_6c43b663:

    # mc "Hola, preciosa."
    mc "Hello, beautiful."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3339
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ac96826c:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Me confundes. Creía que estabas con mi sirvienta...)"
    zeu "*Meow* (You're confusing me. I thought you were with my servant. . .)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3341
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_8dca6ede:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿Pero también estás con estas dos chicas? ¡Debes ser el equivalente a un semental humano!)"
    zeu "*Meow* (But you're with these two girls too? You must be the equivalent of a human stud!)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3343
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f1082c23:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿Pero también esta chica? ¡Debes ser el equivalente a un semental humano!)"
    zeu "*Meow* (But this girl too? You must be the equivalent of a human stud!)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3344
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_9af538dc:

    # mc "Sí, Zeus, voy a enseñarte la casa. No me metas prisa."
    mc "Yes, Zeus, I'll show you around the house. Don't rush me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3347
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_4346f707:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿Estás con las dos chicas? ¡Debes ser el equivalente a un semental humano!)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Are you with both girls? You must be the equivalent of a human stud!)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3348
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_9af538dc_1:

    # mc "Sí, Zeus, voy a enseñarte la casa. No me metas prisa."
    mc "Yes, Zeus, I'll show you around the house. Don't rush me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3349
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f2dd6715:

    # mc "Os veo luego. Vamos, Zeus."
    mc "See you later. Let's go, Zeus."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3351
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_10a86f4b:

    # "La primera parada es la sala de estar, donde están [kat] y [kim]."
    "The first stop is the living room, where [kat] and [kim] are talking."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3352
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_4c34e75e:

    # mc "Hola, chicas. Traigo visita."
    mc "Hello, girls. I bring you a visitor."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3354
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d625f10a:

    # kim "¡Qué bonito! Supongo que este debe de ser Zeus."
    kim "How cute! I guess this must be Zeus."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3355
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b5e1ca31:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¡Mi fama me precede! Me gustas. Una vez conocí a una gata con la piel como la tuya. Ella era más guapa. Y más peluda.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (My reputation precedes me! I like you. I once knew a lady cat with fur like yours. She was prettier. And furrier.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3357
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ce9eba37:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Mía.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Mine.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3359
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_fc52ad29:

    # kat "¡Es precioso!"
    kat "He's gorgeous!"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3360
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f52acb1f:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Tú también eres mía. Tienes pinta de ser mullida para echarme una siesta encima tuyo. Me entra sueño sólo de pensarlo.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (You're mine too. You look soft enough to take a nap on. I'm getting sleepy just thinking about it.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3361
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7f60e2da:

    # mc "Chicas, os tengo que dejar. Voy a seguir enseñándole la casa."
    mc "Girls, I have to go. I'm going to continue showing him around the house."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3364
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b2764ae8:

    # kim "Me encanta poder hacer esto ahora."
    kim "I'm delighted to be able to do this now."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3365
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_0b02ff88:

    # mc "A mí también, cielo."
    mc "Me too, honey."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3367
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_1456d3b7:

    # kim "Hasta luego, [mc]. ¿Vendrás a la clase de tiro de [eva]?"
    kim "See you later, [mc]. Are you coming to [eva]'s shooting class?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3368
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ab5ca70d:

    # mc "No, tuve suficiente con la de ayer y tengo algunas cosas que hacer."
    mc "No, yesterday was enough for me, and I have a few things to do."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3369
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_6e024dc1:

    # kat "Bueno, entonces seremos solo chicas y armas."
    kat "Well, then it'll just be us girls and our guns."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3371
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_c36c1d98:

    # "La siguiente parada es el baño de la planta baja, dónde nada más levantar la tapa del retrete, Zeus se sube a él."
    "The next stop is the bathroom on the ground floor, where Zeus climbs onto the toilet as soon as the lid is lifted."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3372
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_89fd84b0:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿Vas a quedarte ahí mirando?)"
    zeu "*Meow?* (Are you just going to stand there staring?)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3373
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_09c64d23:

    # "Por alguna razón te sientes raro mirando cómo el gato hace sus cosas."
    "For some reason, you feel weird watching the kitty doing his business."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3375
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_a98c077a:

    # "Te giras hasta que acaba, para darle un poco de intimidad. No tienes ni idea de si los gatos necesitan intimidad."
    "You turn away until he's finished, to give him some privacy. You have no idea whether cats need privacy."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3376
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_758c4ae1:

    # "No sabe tirar de la cadena en este retrete y lo haces tú."
    "He doesn't know how to flush this toilet, so you have to do it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3378
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_36109bc7:

    # "Al llegar a la habitación de [dap]..."
    "Upon arriving at [dap]'s room..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3379
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_daabbe21:

    # sca "Mira que gracioso. Ha ido en seguida a ver el cuadro que [mad.nick] hizo de él."
    sca "Look how funny. He went straight to look at the painting [mad.nick] did of him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3380
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b8eb4aca:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Mia. Te nombro Protectora del Sagrado Retrato del Gato Inteligente.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (Mine. I name you Protector of the Smart Cat Sacred Portrait.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3381
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_43b6b919:

    # sca "De pequeña quería tener un gato, pero mi madre no me hubiera dejado nunca."
    sca "When I was a little girl, I wanted to have a cat, but my mother would never have let me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3382
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_13721b2f:

    # zeu "*Miau* (¿Tener? Voy a tener que educarte. Está claro quién es el inteligente aquí.)"
    zeu "*Meow?* *Meow* (Have? I need to educate you. It's clear who's the smart one here.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3385
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f12d5351:

    # mc "Le podemos preguntar a [nor] si te dejaría tener uno."
    mc "We can ask [nor] if she would let you have one."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3386
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_386cbb86:

    # sca "No hace falta. Creo que Zeus va a venir mucho por casa."
    sca "No need. I think Zeus is going to be around a lot."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3387
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_4ff0b71f:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Depende. De momento sólo me han dado un trozo de salchicha.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (It depends. So far, they've only given me a piece of sausage. A small piece.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3389
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ee3410c3:

    # "Salta del armario y sube con curiosidad al regazo de [oma]."
    "The kitten jumps down from the wardrobe and curiously climbs onto [oma]'s lap."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3390
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_c19e3ac0:

    # zeu "*Miau* (Por alguna razón huelo a algo peludo aquí, pero esta chica está perfectamente depilada. Bueno, ahora es mía.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (For some reason, I smell something furry here, but this girl has perfectly waxed legs. Well, now she's mine.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3391
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_e7bf0abd:

    # oma "Parece que tiene curiosidad por mí. *Risa* Los cachorros son tan monos..."
    oma "He seems curious about me. *Laugh* Kittens are so cute..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3392
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_c3c3ec4e:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que le atraen las novedades. Vamos, Zeus. Te tengo que acabar de enseñar la casa."
    mc "*Laugh* I think he's attracted to new things. Come on, Zeus. I have to finish showing you around the house."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3394
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d89e55e2:

    # "Cuando os cruzáis con [bet] en la planta superior..."
    "When you come across [bet] on the top floor..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3395
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_09e3044b:

    # zeu "*Bufido* (No me caes bien. Me parece que eres una rival por la comida.)"
    zeu "*Hiss* (I don't like you. I think you're a rival for food.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3397
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_0058df62:

    # bet "Parece que no le gusto."
    bet "He doesn't seem to like me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3398
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_a6206542:

    # mc "Es extraño. Eres la primera con la que reacciona así."
    mc "That's strange. You're the first one he's reacted like that to."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3399
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_8082c2f6:

    # mc "A lo mejor ya está cansado de pasear por toda la casa."
    mc "Maybe he's tired of walking around the house."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3401
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_46078c94:

    # bet "Puedo llevármelo a la cocina y darle algo de comer si quieres."
    bet "I can take him to the kitchen and give him something to eat, if you want."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3402
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_77fa34b1:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que eso le va a hacer muy feliz."
    mc "*Laugh* I think that will make him very happy."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3404
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_fc660de9:

    # zeu "*Miau* (La había juzgado mal. Alguien como ella seguro que sabe dónde está la mejor comida. Ahora es mía.)"
    zeu "*Meow* (I have misjudged her. Someone like her surely knows where to find the best food. Now she's mine.)"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3405
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_9a7a48ca:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que ya es tu amigo."
    mc "*Laugh* I think he's your friend now."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3406
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_230baf06:

    # bet "*Risa* Sí. Los gatos son tan básicos..."
    bet "*Laugh* Yes. Cats are so basic..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3408
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_6115ac07:

    # "Durante la comida, Zeus hace nuevas amigas."
    "During lunch, Zeus makes some new friends."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3410
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d229ff39:

    # "Todas quieren darle de comer algo."
    "Everyone wants to feed him something."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3412
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_fb055bc9:

    # "[mad.nick] da por perdida la batalla por que no se suba a los muebles. El resto de las chicas lo están empezando a malcriar."
    "[mad.nick] has given up on the battle to stop him from climbing on the furniture. The other girls are starting to spoil him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3413
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_0c3fbf91:

    # "Al menos está lo suficientemente bien educado como para no coger la comida directamente de los platos."
    "At least he's well-mannered enough not to take food directly from people's plates."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3414
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_773d5a9c:

    # "O es lo suficientemente vago como para esperar a que se la den."
    "Or he's lazy enough to wait for it to be handed to him."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3416
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b419ad78:

    # "Al único que no se acerca es a Jamaal. De todas formas ninguno de los dos iba a compartir su comida con el otro."
    "The only one he doesn't go near is Jamaal. Neither of them was going to share their food with the other anyway."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3418
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_e5f1f834:

    # "Supones que, si los gatos tienen un calendario, Zeus estará deseando que lleguen los domingos a partir de ahora."
    "You think that, if cats have a calendar, Zeus will be looking forward to Sundays from now on."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3420
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_f3d76e69:

    # "Al acabar de comer..."
    "After finishing lunch..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3421
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_207aa8fa:

    # mad "Chicas, creo que es el momento de darle nuestro regalo a [mc]. Ha llegado esta mañana."
    mad "Girls, I think it's time to give [mc] our gift. It arrived this morning."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3422
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_34bc92a6:

    # mc "¿Un regalo? ¿Para mí?"
    mc "A gift? For me?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3424
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_cbca8d35:

    # mad "Es una tontería que les propuse a algunas de las chicas el viernes y les pareció una buena idea."
    mad "It's a silly idea I suggested to some of the girls on Friday, and they thought it was a fun thing to do."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3425
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_fd0be7c6:

    # mad "La he mandado a imprimir y me la han entregado poco antes de que llegaras a mi apartamento."
    mad "I sent it to be printed, and it was delivered just before you arrived at my apartment."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3426
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d41497fe:

    # mc "Pero no es mi cumpleaños ni nada por el estilo..."
    mc "But it's not my birthday or anything like that..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3428
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_d5efef94:

    # nor "Pero te lo mereces más ahora que si lo fuese."
    nor "But you deserve it more now than if it were."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3429
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_aa82bc75:

    # bet "Estoy de acuerdo con [nor]. Ha sido una gran idea por parte de [mad.nick]."
    bet "I agree with [nor]. It was a great idea by [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3430
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_e9575096:

    # mc "Dame ese paquete, [mad.nick]"
    mc "Give me that box, [mad.nick]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3432
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_87a29028:

    # mc "¡Oh! ¿Una camiseta?"
    mc "Oh! A T-shirt?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3433
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_02f708a9:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿A quién se le ha ocurrido la frase?"
    mc "*Laugh* Who came up with that line?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3434
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_fce971d3:

    # eri "Fue cosa de [mad.nick]. Nos pareció muy graciosa."
    eri "It was [mad.nick]'s idea. We thought it was very funny."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3435
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_3091e53e:

    # dap "Póntela. Queremos ver cómo te queda."
    dap "Put it on. We want to see how it looks on you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3437
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_21b666b0:

    # mc "*Risa* ¡Me encanta!"
    mc "*Laugh* I love it!"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3438
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7e8ba433:

    # mc "'Desafié a la Iglesia y lo único que conseguí fue esta camiseta y un finiquito para mi tía.'"
    mc "'I defied the Church, and all I got is this T-shirt and severance pay for my aunt.'"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3439
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_3b3c29dd:

    # mc "Bien hecho, [mad.nick]. Y gracias a todas."
    mc "Well done, [mad.nick]. And thank you all."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3441
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_b551a62a:

    # todas "*Risa* No hay de qué."
    todas "*Laugh* You're welcome."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3442
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_9e8be2bd:

    # lis "[mad.nick] es una artista con buenas ideas."
    lis "[mad.nick] is an artist with good ideas."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3443
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_8a5e80eb:

    # mad "Chicas... me vais a hacer ruborizar."
    mad "Girls... you're going to make me blush."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3445
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_396433db:

    # "Después de unas cuantas risas y de que todos consigáis que [mad.nick] se ruborice, vas a tu habitación."
    "After a few laughs and after everyone manages to make [mad.nick] blush, you go to your room."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3446
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_7336d122:

    # "Zeus vuelve a ser el centro de atención después de la pequeña interrupción por la camiseta."
    "Zeus is back in the spotlight after the brief interruption caused by the T-shirt."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3448
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_83af6113:

    # "Ir a comprar los pepinillos no te ha dejado acabar lo que estabas haciendo con la contabilidad del Dormitorio."
    "Going to buy the pickles has kept you from finishing what you were doing with the dorm accounting."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3450
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_ed8271c6:

    # "Ir a comprar el pollo no te ha dejado acabar lo que estabas haciendo con la contabilidad del Dormitorio."
    "Going to buy the chicken has kept you from finishing what you were doing with the dorm accounting."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3452
translate english c25s005_ZeusAtHome_a42c4d50:

    # "[nor] te dice que el helado no está listo todavía. Prepararlo con la leche de [mee] ha sido más lento de lo esperado."
    "[nor] tells you that the ice cream isn't ready yet. Preparing it with [mee]'s milk has taken longer than expected."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3466
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_aeca0d27:

    # "Al cabo de un rato..."
    "After a while..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3467
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3468
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_46915100:

    # ama "*A través de la puerta* Soy yo, ¿puedo pasar?"
    ama "*Through the door* It's me, can I come in?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3469
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_4d601f0e:

    # mc "Sí, pasa."
    mc "Yes, come in."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3471
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d9f612d1:

    # mc "¿Te has cansado ya del gato?"
    mc "Are you tired of the cat yet?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3472
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_730c3bf8:

    # ama "*Risa* No, pero están todas ocupadas con él, con lo que sabía que estarías solo."
    ama "*Laugh* No, but they're all busy with him, so I knew you'd be alone."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3473
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_98dd9003:

    # mc "¿Quieres hablar de algo?"
    mc "Would you like to talk about something in private?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3476
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_8e4413bb:

    # ama "Bueno, quería besarte. *Risita*"
    ama "Well, I wanted to kiss you. *Giggle*"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3477
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_fb98d4e8:

    # mc "Me parece una buena forma de empezar."
    mc "I think that's a good way to start."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3479
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_4c1488fc:

    # ama "Y quería darte las gracias por lo que hiciste ayer en el barco."
    ama "And I wanted to thank you for what you did yesterday on the ship."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3482
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_611a8c6e:

    # ama "Quería darte las gracias por lo que hiciste ayer en el barco."
    ama "I wanted to thank you for what you did yesterday on the ship."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3483
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f6d18e4d:

    # mc "Es lo menos que podía hacer. Me pasé la mitad del tiempo que estuve allí queriendo darle un puñetazo en la cara a Ichigo."
    mc "It was the least I could do. I spent half the time I was there wanting to punch Ichigo in the face."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3485
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f437c1d3:

    # ama "Siempre tienes que sacar el caballero de brillante armadura, ¿no?"
    ama "You always have to bring out the knight in shining armor, don't you?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3487
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_b64f279c:

    # mc "Anoche lo retuve bastante. Lo que me extraña es que Alejandra nos apoyara."
    mc "I held the knight back quite a bit last night. What surprises me is that Alejandra supported us."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3489
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_91ba4451:

    # mc "Anoche lo retuve bastante. Fuiste tú quien intervino con lo de [kim] cuando yo me quedé paralizado. Lo que me extraña es que Alejandra nos apoyara."
    mc "Last night I held the knight back quite a bit. It was you who intervened with [kim] when I was paralyzed. What surprises me is that Alejandra supported us."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3491
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_0c8268ed:

    # ama "Alejandra estaba allí por negocios. Por suficiente dinero, o en su caso cuando no hay otra opción, se puede aceptar cualquier insulto."
    ama "Alejandra was there on business. For enough money, or in her case when there is no other option, you can accept any insult."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3493
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_dde97603:

    # ama "Y fue tu discurso junto con el apoyo de Alejandra lo que me permitió sacar a [kim] de allí."
    ama "And it was your speech, along with Alejandra's support, that allowed me to get [kim] out of there."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3494
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a54cb1f4:

    # ama "De todas formas, que no reaccionaras tan rápido como yo, no significa que no lo fueras a hacer. O eso quiero pensar."
    ama "Anyway, just because you didn't react as quickly as I did, doesn't mean you weren't going to. Or at least I'd like to think so."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3495
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a70383bf:

    # mc "¿Dónde vas? ¿Se ha acabado el abrazo?"
    mc "Where are you going? Is the hug over?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3497
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_e75ae730:

    # ama "No, pero quiero quitarme las botas para continuarlo en la cama, si no te importa."
    ama "No, but I want to take off my boots to continue it on the bed, if you don't mind."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3498
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f26db8d2:

    # mc "*Risa* No me importa."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't mind."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3500
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_dc888c21:

    # mc "¿Sólo las botas?"
    mc "Just the boots?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3502
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_2018f5e4:

    # ama "*Risa* Sí, sólo las botas. No estás pensando que tengo segundas intenciones, ¿verdad? Tan solo quiero un abrazo muy largo."
    ama "*Laugh* Yes, just the boots. You don't think I have ulterior motives, do you? I just want a really long hug."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3504
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_c8c9b586:

    # ama "Y si cae algún beso no voy a decir que no, pero ya está."
    ama "And if a kiss happens, I won't say no, but that's it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3505
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d8b96890:

    # mc "Abrazos y besos me sirve."
    mc "Hugs and kisses are fine with me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3507
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_76bee679:

    # ama "¿Vienes?"
    ama "Are you coming?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3508
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_617dfb78:

    # mc "Déjame quitarme las zapatillas."
    mc "Let me take off my sneakers."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3510
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_2a766e47:

    # ama "Se está bien aquí."
    ama "It's nice here."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3511
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_faafae77:

    # mc "¿Pasa algo, [ama]? Hoy estás más dulce de lo normal. No es que tenga ninguna queja, pero..."
    mc "Is something wrong, [ama]? You seem sweeter than usual today. Not that I have any complaints, but..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3513
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_69801c5e:

    # mc "¿Tiene algo que ver que ayer tuviera la cita-entrenamiento con [eva]?"
    mc "Does it have anything to do with the fact that I had a training-date with [eva] yesterday?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3515
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_ba8a0e6b:

    # ama "No, me he alegrado mucho por ella. Por vosotros dos. Cuando llegué a la base, estaba exultante."
    ama "No. I was so happy for her. For both of you. When I got back to the base, she was elated."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3516
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_254f81c9:

    # ama "*Risa* Y si tuvieras alguna queja porque hoy estoy más dulce, te ibas a tener que aguantar."
    ama "*Laugh* And if you had any complaints about me being sweeter today, you'd just have to put up with it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3519
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_76520bf3:

    # ama "*Risa* Si tuvieras alguna queja porque hoy estoy más dulce, te ibas a tener que aguantar."
    ama "*Laugh* If you have any complaints about me being sweeter today, you'd just have to put up with it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3521
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_0562a6f7:

    # ama "Tan solo quiero pasar un rato a solas con mi novio, sin hacer nada. No hemos tenido mucho tiempo desde... aquel beso. Siempre estamos hablando de trabajo."
    ama "I just want to spend some time alone with my boyfriend, doing nothing. We haven't had much time since... that kiss. We're always talking about work."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3523
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_2275ad91:

    # ama "Tan solo quiero pasar un rato a solas con mi hermano, sin hacer nada. No hemos tenido muchas oportunidades de pasar tiempo juntos si no era por trabajo."
    ama "I just want to spend some time alone with my brother, doing nothing. We haven't had many opportunities to spend time together if it wasn't for work."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3524
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_7f377dcb:

    # mc "Un día tenemos que ir tú y yo a comer, o a cenar. Nada en plan cita. Sólo tú y yo pasando un rato juntos."
    mc "One day, you and I have to go out for lunch or dinner. Nothing fancy. Just you and me spending some time together."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3526
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_b19eddd6:

    # mc "Tenemos que tener tú y yo también una cita algún día."
    mc "You and I should go on a date sometime."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3528
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_33be946b:

    # ama "Estaría bien, pero vas a estar muy ocupado antes de que vayamos a Aruba. Una vez allí te llevaré a mi restaurante favorito."
    ama "That would be nice, but you're going to be very busy before we go to Aruba. Once we get there, I'll take you to my favorite restaurant."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3529
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_019feb62:

    # mc "¿Vendrás tú conmigo? ¿[eva] se quedará aquí protegiendo a la familia?"
    mc "Will you come with me? Will [eva] stay here to protect the family?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3531
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_615741e7:

    # ama "Aún no está preparada para ver a Gavin. Aún está muy afectada por lo que pasó, con que perdiera el brazo. Estaré yo contigo el primer mes."
    ama "She's not ready to see Gavin yet. She's still very upset about what happened, about him losing his arm. I'll be with you for the first month."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3532
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a02ed068:

    # ama "Después iremos rotando, un mes cada una allí mientras la otra está aquí."
    ama "Then we'll take turns, one month each there while the other is here."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3533
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_36a0b53c:

    # mc "Me parece una buena idea. ¿Estará preparada dentro de un mes?"
    mc "That sounds like a good idea. Will she be ready in a month?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3536
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_4fc1e6b9:

    # ama "Eso espero. No tengo ganas de estar lejos de las chicas más de ese tiempo."
    ama "I hope so. I don't want to be away from the girls any longer than that."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3538
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f4f04ed7:

    # ama "Eso espero. Se va a tener que enfrentar a ese tema tarde o temprano."
    ama "I hope so. She'll have to face that issue sooner or later."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3540
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_642c555e:

    # ama "Y, después de lo de ayer, dudo que ella quiera estar lejos de ti más de un mes."
    ama "And, after yesterday, I doubt she wants to be away from you for more than a month."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3541
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_855b4530:

    # mc "¿Cómo te sientes tú por tener que volver a Aruba?"
    mc "How do you feel about having to go back to Aruba?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3543
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_3d1a5af3:

    # ama "Tengo sentimientos conflictivos. Quiero enseñarte dónde crecimos, pero hay sitios que me traerán recuerdos tristes."
    ama "I have mixed feelings. I want to show you where we grew up, but there are places that will bring back sad memories."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3544
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d56b9c53:

    # mc "Lo entiendo."
    mc "I understand."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3546
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_973951c8:

    # ama "Y descubrirás una parte... monstruosa de mí."
    ama "And you'll discover a... terrible part of me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3547
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_85c68686:

    # mc "No creo que haya ninguna parte monstruosa en ti, [ama]. Te obligaron a hacer cosas monstruosas, pero no eres un monstruo."
    mc "I don't think there's any terrible part of you, [ama]. You were forced to do terrible things, but you're not a terrible person."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3549
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_e5fd6cf2:

    # ama "No me refiero a eso. Te enseñaré mi posesión más preciada, y a lo mejor entonces piensas que estoy mal de la cabeza."
    ama "That's not what I mean. I'll show you my most precious possession, and maybe then you'll think I'm completely insane."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3550
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f5b226b8:

    # mc "¿Qué es?"
    mc "What is it?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3552
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f3609450:

    # ama "No sé si decírtelo... no me corresponde sólo a mí."
    ama "I don't know if I should tell you... it's not just up to me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3553
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_811f780f:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Ya llegará el momento de hacerlo."
    mc "Don't worry. The time will come to do it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3554
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_321ec4e6:

    # ama "Gracias..."
    ama "Thank you..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3555
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_30e9b407:

    # mc "Como supongo que tiene que ver con [eva], ¿le has dicho que me lo enseñarás cuando estemos allí?"
    mc "Since I assume it has something to do with [eva], have you told her that you'll show it to me when we're there?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3557
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a860af8f:

    # ama "No, aún no... Me da un poco de miedo decírselo."
    ama "No, not yet... I'm a little scared to tell her."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3558
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f777227d:

    # mc "No le des más vueltas. Si es una cosa vuestra, obviamente me gustaría saberlo, pero habrá tiempo, siempre y cuando [eva] acepte contármelo."
    mc "Don't worry about it. If it's something between you two, I'd obviously like to know, but there's plenty of time, as long as [eva] agrees to let you tell me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3559
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_87cc63f9:

    # ama "Gracias. Para nosotras es muy especial. Para otras personas sería algo... macabro."
    ama "Thank you. It's very special to us. For other people, it would be somewhat... morbid."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3561
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_bb3f24f8:

    # mc "Hablando de cosas especiales. ¿Qué tiene de especial el collar de [eva]?"
    mc "Speaking of special things, what is so special about [eva]'s necklace?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3563
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_ad683714:

    # mc "Le he visto ese corazón puesto cada vez que ha hecho algo... nuevo, por decirlo de alguna forma."
    mc "I've seen that heart of hers every time she's done something... new, so to speak."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3564
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_003e478f:

    # mc "La primera visita con la familia, lo de ayer, y alguna vez más."
    mc "The first visit with the family, yesterday, and a few more times."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3566
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_31f6a996:

    # ama "No te lo puedo decir, [mc]. Se lo deberías preguntar a ella..."
    ama "I can't tell you, [mc]. You should ask her..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3567
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_c34ef301:

    # mc "No te preocupes. Espero que no sea nada... ¿cómo has dicho? Ah, sí. Macabro."
    mc "Don't worry. I hope it's nothing... What did you say? Oh, yes. Morbid."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3571
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_2c8733c9:

    # mc "Cambiando de tema. ¿Hay alguien a quien quieras evitar en Aruba?"
    mc "Changing the subject. Is there anyone you want to avoid in Aruba?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3573
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_947dcd6f:

    # ama "Especialmente a Daniels. Por su culpa murieron tres de mis hermanas y Arnau, el hermano de Aaron."
    ama "Only Daniels. Because of him, three of my sisters and Aaron's brother Arnau died."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3574
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_9c96c333:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. No tienes por qué verlo. Aaron y yo nos podemos ocupar de hacer lo que sea necesario."
    mc "I understand. You don't have to see him. Aaron and I can take care of whatever needs to be done."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3577
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_58cc0162:

    # ama "Gracias. ¿Por qué no te callas y me dejas disfrutar de este abrazo en paz? No quiero pensar en trabajo."
    ama "Thanks. Why don't you shut up and let me enjoy this hug in silence? I don't want to think about work."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3580
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_b9c8e4f9:

    # ama "Gracias. Sois muy parecidos y no me vais a dejar hacer nada que me haga daño."
    ama "Thank you. You are very similar, and you will not let me do anything that could harm me."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3581
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f05d1af5:

    # mc "En eso consiste protegerte, ¿no? Me encanta que, alguna vez, podamos ser otros los que te protegemos a ti."
    mc "That's what protecting you is all about, isn't it? I love that, sometimes, we can be the ones protecting you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3583
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_4c9ecae2:

    # ama "*Risa* El caballero de brillante armadura ha vuelto."
    ama "*Laugh* The knight in shining armor is back."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3584
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d9a20a23:

    # mc "*Risa* Ni siquiera me había dado cuenta."
    mc "*Laugh* I hadn't even noticed."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3585
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_67a4ac62:

    # mc "Pero no querías que habláramos de trabajo..."
    mc "But you didn't want us to talk about work..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3587
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_31c71ae0:

    # ama "No, quería disfrutar de un abrazo en silencio. *Risa* Pero eso contigo es imposible."
    ama "No, I just wanted to enjoy a moment of silence while cuddling. *Laugh* But that's impossible with you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3588
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_cb0ba765:

    # mc "*Risa* ¿Hablo demasiado?"
    mc "*Laugh* Do I talk too much?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3589
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_0e7ec165:

    # ama "*Risa* La mayoría del tiempo."
    ama "*Laugh* Most of the time."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3590
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_dc2bd698:

    # mc "*Risa* Déjame hacerte una última pregunta y me callaré."
    mc "*Laugh* Let me ask you one last question, and then I'll shut up."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3592
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a30458cd:

    # ama "*Risa* Me das miedo. Haz esa pregunta."
    ama "*Laugh* You're scaring me. Ask the question."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3593
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_3e88635e:

    # mc "Dices que tengo que esperar a llegar a Aruba para una cita contigo. ¿Por qué no podemos ir a cenar mañana, por ejemplo?"
    mc "You say I have to wait until we get to Aruba to go on a date with you. Why can't we go out to dinner tomorrow, for example?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3595
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_aa536e84:

    # ama "Porque no soy como [sai]."
    ama "Because I'm not like [sai]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3596
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_9eed75b0:

    # mc "¿A qué te refieres?"
    mc "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3597
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_ef86d131:

    # ama "Sabes que [sai] estuvo planificando vuestra primera vez juntos desde vuestra primera cita, ¿no?"
    ama "You know [sai] planned your first time together since your first date, right?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3598
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_af008da4:

    # mc "Sí, lo ha comentado varias veces. Siempre me pareció gracioso que se pasara una semana planeándolo para que fuera perfecto."
    mc "Yes, she mentioned it several times. I always thought it was funny that she spent a week planning it so that it would be perfect."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3599
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_6ce0b2fd:

    # mc "¿Quieres decir que no quieres planearlo?"
    mc "You mean you don't want to plan it?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3601
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d5dec225:

    # ama "Quiero decir que no quiero pensar en ello. A diferencia de [sai], no considero el sexo importante."
    ama "I mean I don't want to think about it. Unlike [sai], I don't consider sex important."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3602
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_56833dc0:

    # ama "Sé que para ti sí que lo es, pero yo me podría pasar los próximos meses haciendo solo esto, abrazándonos."
    ama "I know it is for you, but I could spend the next few months just doing this, cuddling."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3604
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f2aba790:

    # ama "Y esto."
    ama "And also this."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3606
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_dd444808:

    # ama "Estar así, abrazados, es suficiente para mí ahora mismo."
    ama "Just being like this, holding each other, is enough for me right now."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3607
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_2ef475ba:

    # mc "¿Y qué tiene eso que ver con que salgamos a cenar?"
    mc "And what does that have to do with us going out to dinner?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3609
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_820a937f:

    # ama "*Risa* Si planificamos una salida a cenar, los dos sabemos qué pasará después."
    ama "*Laugh* If we plan to go out to dinner, we both know what will happen next."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3610
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f4dac36c:

    # mc "Sólo pasará lo que tú quieras que pase, [ama]."
    mc "The only thing that will happen is what you want to happen, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3612
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_456bd3ac:

    # ama "La diferencia es que, entonces, querré que pase."
    ama "The difference is that, then, I will want it to happen."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3613
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_52027a02:

    # ama "Mientras nos veamos un ratito aquí, un ratito allá, sin planificar nada... no hay expectativas. Ni tiempo para que pase nada."
    ama "As long as we see each other here and there, without planning anything... there are no expectations. No time for anything to happen."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3614
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_9fb1ee18:

    # mc "Pero es que no es necesario que pase nada. Abrazarte me encanta."
    mc "But nothing needs to happen. I just love hugging you."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3616
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_7caf1c9a:

    # ama "Pero tarde o temprano querrás sexo. No me malinterpretes. Lo entiendo."
    ama "But sooner or later you'll want sex. Don't get me wrong. I understand."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3617
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_6dc40a64:

    # ama "Pero quiero que mi... nuestra primera vez sea especial. Estar preparada."
    ama "But I want my... our first time to be special. To be ready."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3618
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_e1eb3a86:

    # mc "Espera. ¿Has dicho tu primera vez?"
    mc "Wait. Did you say your first time?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3620
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f181a472:

    # ama "Sí..."
    ama "Yes..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3621
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_8f1f9cea:

    # mc "Creía que a todas las espías os entrenaban para..."
    mc "I thought all female spies were trained to..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3623
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_8a16de32:

    # mc "Me sorprendió con [eva], pero me la podía imaginar estrangulando al instructor que se lo propusiera."
    mc "I was surprised by [eva], but I could imagine her strangling any instructor who tried to do that."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3625
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_7be4a361:

    # ama "*Risa* Eso solo pasa en las películas sobre el KGB. Yo no tuve que hacer la fase avanzada del entrenamiento de seducción."
    ama "*Laugh* That only happens in movies about the KGB. I didn't have to do the advanced seduction training."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3627
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_7afc5846:

    # ama "Claire, y Diana sí que lo hicieron."
    ama "Claire and Diana did it."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3628
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_9f93bc5d:

    # ama "Ni [eva] ni yo lo hicimos. Creyeron que nuestras habilidades encajaban mejor en otros campos."
    ama "Neither [eva] nor I did. They believed that our skills were better suited to other fields."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3629
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_fba4b465:

    # mc "Es decir, ¿voy a ser el primer chico con el que estés?"
    mc "You mean, am I going to be the first guy you've ever been with?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3631
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_08ffe5d6:

    # ama "Sí... Aparte de algún beso fingido en alguna operación..."
    ama "Yes... Except for a few fake kisses during an operation..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3632
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_629dfe10:

    # ama "De hecho, eres el primer chico a quien he besado de verdad..."
    ama "In fact, you're the first guy I've ever really kissed..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3633
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_de1b5658:

    # mc "Y tienes miedo, ¿no?"
    mc "And you're scared, aren't you?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3634
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_cd9bbd02:

    # ama "Es imposible no tenerlo. Claire se volvió adicta al sexo. Diana lo odió cada minuto. ¿Qué me va a pasar a mí?"
    ama "It's impossible not to be. Claire became addicted to sex. Diana hated every minute of it. What's going to happen to me?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3635
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_06e300a4:

    # mc "Que tú lo vas a hacer voluntariamente."
    mc "That you're going to do it willingly."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3638
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_7d530748:

    # ama "[eva] lo hizo voluntariamente ayer y ya está pensando en la próxima vez. ¿Le está pasando lo mismo que a Claire?"
    ama "[eva] did it willingly yesterday and she's already thinking about the next time. Is she going through the same thing as Claire?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3639
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_913880aa:

    # mc "No, [ama]. No es eso."
    mc "No, [ama]. It's not that."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3641
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d1a60d81:

    # ama "¿Y si no me gusta? ¿Y si no te gusta... conmigo?"
    ama "What if I don't like it? What if you don't like it... with me?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3642
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_fb267559:

    # mc "Ese puente lo cruzaremos cuando toque. Pero estoy dispuesto a tener una relación basada en abrazos, si es necesario."
    mc "We'll cross that bridge when we get there. But I'm willing to have a relationship based on hugs, if necessary."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3643
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_00b5973a:

    # mc "Y en besos. Muchos besos. Y quiero uno ahora."
    mc "And kisses. Lots of kisses. And I want one now."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3645
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_68dd5088:

    # ama "Eso puedo hacerlo... pero no quiero que pase de ahí ahora mismo."
    ama "I can do that... but I don't want it to go any further than that right now."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3646
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_935b9e7f:

    # mc "Solo quiero un beso, nada más."
    mc "I just want a kiss, nothing more."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3648
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_2cf44064:

    # "[ama] te da un dubitativo beso."
    "[ama] kisses you hesitantly."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3649
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_92f0a069:

    # "En el momento en que vuestros alientos se entremezclan, las dudas empiezan a desaparecer en la preciosa mujer."
    "The moment your breaths intertwine, the doubts begin to fade away in the beautiful woman."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3650
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_1a5b2169:

    # "Cuando el beso se empieza a convertir en apasionado, [ama] rompe el contacto de vuestros labios y vuelve a su posición sobre tu pecho."
    "When the kiss starts to become passionate, [ama] breaks the contact of your lips and returns to her position on your chest."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3652
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_4f3a7da6:

    # ama "¿Contento?"
    ama "Happy?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3653
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a1fcf11a:

    # mc "Muy contento. No necesito nada más."
    mc "Very happy. I don't need anything else."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3654
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_248a40e3:

    # ama "*Susurrando* Yo tampoco..."
    ama "*Whispering* Me neither..."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3656
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_514d5fa3:

    # "Pasáis un rato abrazados, en silencio, disfrutando de la compañía del otro."
    "You spend some time hugging, in silence, enjoying each other's company."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3658
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_dd0461ef_1:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Knock-Knock*"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3659
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_7d75f62b:

    # mar "*A través de la puerta* Somos [nor] y yo. ¿Podemos pasar?"
    mar "*Through the door* It's [nor] and me. Can we come in?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3660
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_5da7a14a:

    # "La rubia mercenaria contesta antes de que puedas decir nada."
    "The blonde mercenary answers before you can say anything."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3661
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f3c9df14:

    # ama "Sí, adelante."
    ama "Yes, come in."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3663
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_a49668f4:

    # mar "¡Oh, [ama]! No sabíamos que estabas aquí."
    mar "Oh, [ama]! We didn't know you were here."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3664
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_bb9d8962:

    # nor "Veníamos a preguntarle a [mc] si sabía dónde estabas."
    nor "We came to ask [mc] if he knew where you were."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3666
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_3898adf7:

    # ama "Estábamos charlando y hemos acabado aquí. ¿Por qué no os unís?"
    ama "We were just chatting and ended up here. Why don't you join us?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3667
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_44b1bfeb:

    # mc "Un abrazo en familia. Estaría bien."
    mc "A family hug. That would be nice."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3669
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_eced1447:

    # nor "Me parece una gran idea."
    nor "I think that's a great idea."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3670
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_f96f2ae9:

    # mar "¿No molestamos?"
    mar "Are you sure we're not bothering you?"

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3671
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_228328af:

    # mc "Nunca molestáis. Dejad la puerta abierta por si viene alguien más."
    mc "You're never a bother. Leave the door open in case someone else comes."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3673
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_83c4f095:

    # "Os acomodáis los cuatro como podéis en la cama."
    "The four of you settle down as best as you can on the bed."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3674
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_d4f73925:

    # nor "*Risa* Podríamos instaurar esto como costumbre los domingos. Y añadir al resto de las chicas."
    nor "*Laugh* We could make this a Sunday tradition. And add the rest of the girls."

# game/scripts/c25/c25.rpy:3675
translate english c25s006_AmaCuddle_4123e44f:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que entonces debería comprar una cama más grande."
